  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in the tandoor clay pot over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the grated carrots and cook for 2 minutes",
    "Add the shredded cabbage and cook until wilted",
    "Add the rice flour noodles and cook for 2 minutes",
    "Add the soy sauce, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine",
    "Add the vanilla extract and stir to combine",
    "Use a small amount of water to shape the noodles into nigiri shapes",
    "Serve the pancit canton hot in the tandoor clay pot"
